1
00:00:15,096 --> 00:00:23,540
Bonjour, Marinette ! Aujourd’hui, c’est samedi 13. Tu es libre lundi ?
Hi, Marinette! Today is Saturday the 13th. Are you free Monday?

2
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:32,492
Bonjour, Adrien. Oui ! Le mardi, j’ai cours ; le mercredi aussi.
Hi, Adrien. Yes! I have class on Tuesdays; on Wednesdays too.

3
00:00:32,592 --> 00:00:35,900
Et le jeudi, tu es libre ?
And are you free on Thursdays?

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,836
Non, je travaille le vendredi.
No, I work on Fridays.

5
00:00:39,936 --> 00:00:46,076
Alors, on se voit lundi 15 ? Après-demain, c’est lundi.
So, shall we see each other Monday the 15th? The day after tomorrow is Monday.

6
00:00:46,176 --> 00:00:52,292
Oui ! Le lendemain, mardi 16, j’ai cours.
Yes! The following day, Tuesday the 16th, I have class.

7
00:00:52,392 --> 00:00:58,412
D’accord. On prépare tout la veille, dimanche 14 ?
Okay. Shall we prepare everything the day before, Sunday the 14th?

8
00:00:58,512 --> 00:01:04,340
Avec plaisir ! Le samedi, je fais du vélo.
Gladly! On Saturdays, I ride my bike.
